;s 8 grids runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. February to March came in under 90% of normal in 40 of those years, and July to August in 24. In 2025, November to December finished at 25% of normal on the middle of the grids, and March to April at 33%. Grid 8596 had its driest year in 2000 at 58% of normal.</p>"}
